From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Juan Pablo Lassala <jpablolassala@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] background: Do not start under Caminito

Caminito, the Wayland compositor for MATE, draws the wallpaper with a
program of its own, caminito-wallpaperd, which has a wallpaper for each
output. With both, the plugin's surfaces would be drawn in the same
layer as caminito-wallpaperd's, and each output would show whichever
was on top.

When MATE_WM_NAME is Caminito, do not start the manager. Without that
variable, nothing changes.
---
 plugins/background/msd-background-plugin.c | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/plugins/background/msd-background-plugin.c b/plugins/background/msd-background-plugin.c
index 55d88f5..16d2e6e 100644
--- a/plugins/background/msd-background-plugin.c
+++ b/plugins/background/msd-background-plugin.c
@@ -72,6 +72,14 @@ impl_activate (MateSettingsPlugin* plugin)
 	gboolean res;
 	GError* error;
 
+	/* Caminito, the Wayland compositor for MATE, has its own program to
+	 * draw the wallpaper, with a wallpaper for each output, and this
+	 * plugin's would be drawn with it. */
+	if (g_strcmp0 (g_getenv ("MATE_WM_NAME"), "Caminito") == 0) {
+		g_debug ("Not activating background plugin under Caminito");
+		return;
+	}
+
 	g_debug("Activating background plugin");
 
 	error = NULL;
